                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2019-1010024**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | libc6  | 2.41-12+deb13u4  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:13  | [CVE-2019-1010024](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2019-1010024)  |\n"
