            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119591-libsqlite3-0",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119591 medium vulnerability for libsqlite3-0 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains a stack exhaustion vulnerability in countOfViewOptimization() that allows attackers to crash the host process via count(*) over a large multi-row VALUES clause. Attackers supplying SQL or a database file with a crafted view can trigger deeply nested TK_PLUS expressions whose recursive freeing in sqlite3ExprDeleteNN() exhausts the C stack, causing denial of service."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-119591",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-119591\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libsqlite3-0\nVersion: 3.46.1-7+deb13u2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:13\nLink: [CVE-2026-119591](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-119591)",
